# countdown: prints 54321
#
# Row 0 seeds the counter and drops the eye into the loop.
# Row 1 is the loop body; it is exactly as wide as the plate, so running off the
# east edge wraps straight back to its own start. The guard at x=0 is the exit:
# once the decremented counter reaches zero it turns south into row 2, which is
# void, and the machine halts.
%plate 6x3

o.57  v0.7  ....  ....  ....  ....
v2.7  %0.7  +0.7  o.17  #1.7  %0.7
....  ....  ....  ....  ....  ....
